      "name": "FLD_ZONE",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "Flood zone. A, AE, AO, V, and VE are Special Flood Hazard Areas, the 1-percent-annual-chance flood. V and VE also carry wave action. \"0.2 PCT ANNUAL CHANCE FLOOD HAZARD\" lies between the 1-percent and 0.2-percent-annual-chance floods. See the [FEMA flood zone glossary](https://www.fema.gov/about/glossary/flood-zones)."
    },
    {
      "name": "SFHA_TF",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "T when the zone is a Special Flood Hazard Area, F otherwise."
    },
